        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Do you need to be alone?",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I could wrap this up and get the fuck away instead",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "What is your wish? It can be granted",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "You're number one, one on my list",
          "rhyme": "ist",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "See, I am Santa, where is Rudolph?",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "You're parasitic, I do not have self-control",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "I am startin' to wonder, is this my free will or yours? (Yours, yours, yours)",
          "rhyme": "uR",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCADEFGH",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCADEFGH"
    },
